WEBVTT

00:00:05.830 --> 00:00:08.650
This is Ochre Ring's woodland, Top Chen.

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:12.520
Compared to when I was last here, the Musa have flourished.

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:15.660
Yes. But, going through here...

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:17.400
Be that as it may, we must go!

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:20.030
Find Tiz quickly and return!

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:23.620
Third...

00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:28.100
Third,

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:31.490
what are you looking at?

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:33.920
Don't know... What, I wonder?..

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:37.080
That kid, is it?

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:40.340
About Thor...

00:00:40.710 --> 00:00:44.470
just what is it you are expecting from that kid?

00:00:45.490 --> 00:00:48.190
It's interesting. I just can't help but watch...

00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:52.310
That guy will do something, there's no doubt about it.

00:02:30.110 --> 00:02:32.280
When did they grow this much?

00:02:33.210 --> 00:02:33.860
Thor!

00:02:39.240 --> 00:02:40.250
How's that?!

00:02:42.530 --> 00:02:44.180
Don't scare me like that!

00:02:44.730 --> 00:02:47.510
Swinging around on Musa vines isn't that unusual, is it?

00:02:48.080 --> 00:02:50.730
It'd be good for you start learn how to use vines to swing too.

00:02:51.240 --> 00:02:53.230
I'm not a flying squirrel.

00:02:53.680 --> 00:02:56.360
So, where are you planning on going?

00:02:56.620 --> 00:02:59.230
Well, I just think this place is really beautiful.

00:03:00.010 --> 00:03:03.320
Musa's bud's are drawing water up from under the ground.

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:09.290
Its germination did cause many deaths at first, but Musa also brought us water.

00:03:11.690 --> 00:03:13.660
I wish Rai could have seen this too.

00:03:15.310 --> 00:03:17.040
If I'd been just a bit faster...

00:03:19.230 --> 00:03:20.050
Rai...

00:03:21.560 --> 00:03:23.090
That wasn't your fault! You can't blame yourself.

00:03:23.820 --> 00:03:25.750
Back then I could only think that Rai was getting in the way.

00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:33.760
I thought it would've been better if I were the only one alive.

00:03:34.160 --> 00:03:35.270
Naturally!

00:03:35.680 --> 00:03:38.110
Otherwise you wouldn't have been able to survive In Chimera!

00:03:39.010 --> 00:03:40.810
I hated Rai.

00:03:41.630 --> 00:03:43.340
But as much as I hated him, I loved him too.

00:03:44.440 --> 00:03:45.680
All were my true feelings.

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:47.280
They weren't lies.

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:48.740
Thor...

00:03:50.100 --> 00:03:52.080
I'm turn 12 soon.

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:55.870
That being the case, I'll have to grow into adulthood on this planet.

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:57.540
I want to know...

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:00.090
who was it that killed my parents?

00:04:00.930 --> 00:04:03.460
Why were we abandoned here on this planet?

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:06.420
Colin could...

00:04:07.210 --> 00:04:08.930
Colin might know something about it!

00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:11.180
Colin?

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:14.520
Not long ago he was left here as a criminal.

00:04:14.660 --> 00:04:16.270
He's a strange one with a white beard,

00:04:16.580 --> 00:04:18.440
but he knows a lot,

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:21.190
and taught us heaps about the outer world.

00:04:22.180 --> 00:04:23.780
That person, where is he?

00:04:24.670 --> 00:04:27.350
He lives alone in the rocky region near the Sun Ring.

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:28.910
Is it far from here?

00:04:29.150 --> 00:04:31.240
No, not really...

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:34.290
Tiz, I want to meet Colin.

00:04:34.900 --> 00:04:36.790
Take me there right now.

00:04:37.230 --> 00:04:38.650
To Colin's place?

00:04:38.850 --> 00:04:39.460
You can't?

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:41.240
It's not that I can't...

00:04:41.600 --> 00:04:44.300
It's near the Sun Ring, and well...

00:04:44.710 --> 00:04:47.820
That's right; since you left without permission.

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:49.220
Then...

00:04:50.110 --> 00:04:53.580
No, sooner or later I will have to talk to Top.

00:04:54.230 --> 00:04:56.250
In any case, it won't end like this.

00:04:57.340 --> 00:04:58.520
Right, let's go!

00:05:00.660 --> 00:05:03.640
What? Thor and Tiz disappeared?

00:05:03.970 --> 00:05:04.660
Yes.

00:05:05.130 --> 00:05:07.240
For god's sake!... Where did they go?

00:05:07.920 --> 00:05:09.740
You don't think they went to the Sun Ring, do you?

00:05:10.290 --> 00:05:11.200
The Sun Ring?

00:05:11.600 --> 00:05:13.250
And... uh...

00:05:13.470 --> 00:05:14.330
What is it?

00:05:14.640 --> 00:05:18.140
The Sun Ring's women... are on the way here.

00:05:18.620 --> 00:05:20.730
And their Top, Chen-san, is with them.

00:05:20.990 --> 00:05:21.710
What?!

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:25.000
Are you going after them?

00:05:25.330 --> 00:05:26.230
Of course.

00:05:28.030 --> 00:05:31.220
If Chen runs into the two of them now it'll be a disaster.

00:05:31.650 --> 00:05:34.430
Even your going won't help, Third!

00:05:35.030 --> 00:05:37.680
It's about time we reconciled with Sun Ring.

00:05:38.600 --> 00:05:40.730
We'll have to mediate to resolve this dispute.

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:43.400
Please take care, ok.

00:05:43.850 --> 00:05:46.280
What you did to her was immoral.

00:05:46.930 --> 00:05:48.780
Yeah, I will.

00:05:54.030 --> 00:05:55.490
Oi wait, Thor!

00:05:57.480 --> 00:06:00.040
This type of seeding tree is more dangerous that it looks!

00:06:00.310 --> 00:06:04.130
Seed tree? Meaning the type which bears seeds?

00:06:04.390 --> 00:06:05.750
They're really nutritious,

00:06:06.020 --> 00:06:07.630
but extremely dangerous to pick.

00:06:08.290 --> 00:06:10.220
A deadly poison is released as soon as you pick one.

00:06:12.340 --> 00:06:14.600
Just like a mother protecting her child.

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:17.060
Mysterious isn't it?

00:06:17.690 --> 00:06:22.480
In Chimera, plants are more passionate than humans, aren't they.

00:06:23.420 --> 00:06:25.110
Err... What?

00:06:26.150 --> 00:06:29.400
Chimera and Juno really are different.

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:32.810
Just as I thought Thor, you really are clever!

00:06:33.210 --> 00:06:35.220
As expected from a man chosen by me!

00:06:38.780 --> 00:06:40.870
<i>There's much more I have to learn about this planet.</i>

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:44.750
<i>Otherwise I won't be able to leave here alive.</i>

00:06:45.290 --> 00:06:47.630
Anyway, let's get going, Thor!

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:51.260
You'll have a lot to talk about with Colin.

00:06:53.840 --> 00:06:54.740
Who's there?!

00:06:56.140 --> 00:06:57.260
That's your greeting, right?

00:06:58.320 --> 00:07:00.980
Is that way to welcome your Top,

00:07:01.630 --> 00:07:02.230
Tiz?!

00:07:03.170 --> 00:07:03.940
Chen!

00:07:04.940 --> 00:07:09.150
Sun Ring's female Top, my former boss.

00:07:10.480 --> 00:07:11.850
Come back, Tiz.

00:07:12.260 --> 00:07:14.130
Betraying us on a whim won't be forgiven.

00:07:14.360 --> 00:07:15.300
Listen, Chen;

00:07:15.760 --> 00:07:18.600
I... he saved my life.

00:07:18.940 --> 00:07:22.520
That's why I hope I can repay him someday.

00:07:22.820 --> 00:07:24.900
That's the reason why I want to stay with him!

00:07:25.410 --> 00:07:27.420
Who is that? That person.

00:07:27.910 --> 00:07:29.050
He's called Thor.

00:07:29.350 --> 00:07:31.710
He was just abandoned here.

00:07:32.100 --> 00:07:34.300
So if I don't follow him...

00:07:34.370 --> 00:07:37.850
Impossible! I won't give you to him.

00:07:39.060 --> 00:07:39.850
Chen...

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:43.990
I'll say it one more time: return to the Sun Ring with me.

00:07:45.760 --> 00:07:47.200
I won't go back!

00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:50.200
I'm... already Thor's subordinate!

00:07:53.760 --> 00:07:54.600
Aim!

00:07:57.810 --> 00:07:58.440
Chen!

00:07:59.340 --> 00:08:00.740
Think it over.

00:08:01.220 --> 00:08:05.120
Come back... or die here with him?

00:08:06.260 --> 00:08:06.960
Stop this!

00:08:08.270 --> 00:08:11.460
She already said she doesn't want to! Stop trying to force her!

00:08:11.940 --> 00:08:15.840
Tiz has been accepted to stay in Ochre Ring by Ochre's Top!

00:08:16.830 --> 00:08:19.600
You shouldn't say that Ochre's Top ''accepted" her.

00:08:20.580 --> 00:08:22.510
He just doesn't want to interfere.

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:25.680
Chimera's women are special;

00:08:26.290 --> 00:08:29.020
an invaluable resource making up only 20% of the population.

00:08:29.470 --> 00:08:34.400
Losing even one of them means the chance of continuing your bloodline is reduced.

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:36.030
Now, Tiz.

00:08:36.760 --> 00:08:38.700
Your life depends on this. Stop this nonsense.

00:08:39.230 --> 00:08:39.870
Come back!

00:08:43.560 --> 00:08:44.450
I'll come.

00:08:44.870 --> 00:08:45.580
Tiz?!

00:08:46.300 --> 00:08:50.040
Chen is serious. Saying anything now is useless.

00:08:50.640 --> 00:08:52.210
But, you don't want to go back, do you?

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:56.550
I don't want you to be in any danger because of me.

00:08:57.240 --> 00:08:58.000
Tiz...

00:08:58.530 --> 00:08:59.640
Now, let's go!

00:09:00.390 --> 00:09:01.070
Yes.

00:09:17.810 --> 00:09:20.700
That thing by her feet... could it be...

00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:29.670
Tiz, get back!

00:09:37.670 --> 00:09:40.220
Where were you aiming? Is that all you can do?

00:09:42.100 --> 00:09:42.810
Top!!!

00:09:43.880 --> 00:09:44.760
Tiz, hurry.

00:09:51.710 --> 00:09:55.640
You're an idiot! Really... really an idiot!!!

00:09:56.180 --> 00:09:58.970
I just saved you! How can you call me an idiot?

00:09:59.780 --> 00:10:03.410
Doing something like this... you will definitely be killed.

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:07.580
Definitely... you will definitely be killed!!!

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:17.590
That brat;

00:10:17.990 --> 00:10:20.220
until we find them, can he hold out

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:23.720
against that Sun Ring's female Top, Chen?

00:10:24.820 --> 00:10:28.400
You still don't understand how tough he is?

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:30.250
Wanna bet?

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:36.400
What should we do?

00:10:36.440 --> 00:10:37.930
Doing something like this to Chen...

00:10:38.260 --> 00:10:40.110
We'll be done for...

00:10:40.540 --> 00:10:42.780
I wasn't actually trying to kill her...

00:10:43.590 --> 00:10:45.780
She should have been able to dodge.

00:10:45.890 --> 00:10:48.800
They'll just think you're using that as an excuse.

00:10:50.220 --> 00:10:52.330
I won't ever be able to go back to the Sun Ring again.

00:10:53.260 --> 00:10:54.020
Sorry.

00:10:55.690 --> 00:10:57.940
You got involved because of me.

00:10:59.190 --> 00:11:01.920
I decided to go with you myself;

00:11:02.440 --> 00:11:03.930
you don't need to apologize.

00:11:06.150 --> 00:11:07.930
Tiz, please,

00:11:08.510 --> 00:11:10.850
take me to the place where Colin lives.

00:11:11.770 --> 00:11:12.600
Thor!

00:11:12.860 --> 00:11:14.520
We can sort everything out when we get there.

00:11:14.980 --> 00:11:17.230
We can still get through the night even if we're not with any Ring.

00:11:17.740 --> 00:11:21.740
Thor... you are incredible.

00:11:22.180 --> 00:11:25.240
You're an outsider; how can you be this tough?

00:11:25.760 --> 00:11:29.060
And... you went to the trouble to join Ochre Ring,

00:11:29.090 --> 00:11:30.450
but then you just...

00:11:32.310 --> 00:11:34.920
I didn't join the Ochre Ring.

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:38.840
I didn't have any choice, so I stayed there till now.

00:11:39.630 --> 00:11:41.840
Anyway, I'm more interested in Colin.

00:11:42.770 --> 00:11:44.720
He knows a lot, right?

00:11:45.570 --> 00:11:48.050
And if Tiz's wasn't with me,

00:11:48.700 --> 00:11:50.760
I'd have no companion at all.

00:11:50.920 --> 00:11:51.900
Companion?...

00:11:51.950 --> 00:11:55.270
Let's just create a new Ring.

00:11:55.890 --> 00:11:58.560
I'm the Top, Tiz can be Second.

00:11:59.850 --> 00:12:02.760
A Ring should be ruled by 3 people.

00:12:02.890 --> 00:12:04.400
We don't have a Third.

00:12:05.630 --> 00:12:08.660
It's ok; we'll recruit a Third.

00:12:10.550 --> 00:12:11.540
How weird.

00:12:14.510 --> 00:12:17.580
Our skin colours are so different.

00:12:17.990 --> 00:12:19.650
A Ring shared by only two people...

00:12:20.330 --> 00:12:23.130
Then, what colour should we name our Ring?

00:12:25.260 --> 00:12:26.720
There's no colour.

00:12:27.160 --> 00:12:29.950
It's my ring, so we should just call it ''Thor Ring''.

00:12:33.200 --> 00:12:35.350
You... what nonsense!

00:12:35.390 --> 00:12:36.640
Really?

00:12:46.630 --> 00:12:47.600
That dagger is!...

00:12:50.490 --> 00:12:51.530
You've been hiding well.

00:12:52.970 --> 00:12:54.190
I'll return this.

00:12:54.620 --> 00:12:56.530
Tiz's dagger, which you threw.

00:12:56.910 --> 00:12:58.580
Have you come to your senses?

00:12:58.850 --> 00:13:01.170
Now, Tiz, come here!

00:13:01.790 --> 00:13:03.440
Tiz, hide somewhere.

00:13:03.780 --> 00:13:04.400
Thor!

00:13:04.740 --> 00:13:08.220
Tiz, this is your last chance, come back.

00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:14.930
Thor, let's just apologize here...

00:13:18.960 --> 00:13:20.160
What a surprise!

00:13:20.750 --> 00:13:22.190
It seems like this one wants to die.

00:13:22.680 --> 00:13:24.150
We're the ones who are surprised.

00:13:24.740 --> 00:13:26.690
You already lost against me once!

00:13:27.080 --> 00:13:28.070
What's that?

00:13:28.370 --> 00:13:32.240
When you were caught off guard by the Calypso, I could've killed you if I wanted to.

00:13:32.630 --> 00:13:35.660
Wouldn't it be to your shame, to kill me here?

00:13:36.300 --> 00:13:37.540
Let's end this!

00:13:37.680 --> 00:13:38.960
What you thing you're saying?!

00:13:39.850 --> 00:13:40.870
I see.

00:13:43.550 --> 00:13:46.180
You really don't know anything, do you?

00:13:47.040 --> 00:13:50.090
Saying you want to challenge a Top to a duel

00:13:50.490 --> 00:13:54.890
means that you want to become Top in her place.

00:13:55.630 --> 00:13:59.240
As a man, I can't possibly be aiming to become Sun Ring's female Top.

00:13:59.990 --> 00:14:01.940
What I want is Tiz's freedom.

00:14:02.220 --> 00:14:03.400
Nonsense, Thor!

00:14:03.730 --> 00:14:05.400
Chen's an amazing fighter!

00:14:05.810 --> 00:14:09.850
Don't worry; I learnt martial arts in PE.

00:14:11.050 --> 00:14:11.910
Very well.

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:16.650
Let me cut you up!

00:14:45.300 --> 00:14:47.160
No way! With one hand...

00:14:47.920 --> 00:14:49.260
A nimble brat, aren't you.

00:14:50.620 --> 00:14:53.040
You have good reflexes; you have my praise...

00:14:53.570 --> 00:14:55.780
But that knife is too good for the likes of you.

00:14:56.170 --> 00:14:59.100
When I win, that beam knife will be mine.

00:14:59.410 --> 00:15:00.160
Thor!

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:02.250
This is no good...

00:15:02.990 --> 00:15:03.840
Calm down.

00:15:04.340 --> 00:15:06.540
...what... what could be her weakness?

00:15:08.580 --> 00:15:09.590
That sword...

00:15:11.860 --> 00:15:13.810
That's right, it made a weird sound back then...

00:15:16.250 --> 00:15:17.100
Let's go!

00:15:19.840 --> 00:15:20.440
She's coming.

00:15:36.150 --> 00:15:37.840
My...sword...

00:15:46.540 --> 00:15:47.650
I win.

00:15:48.180 --> 00:15:50.840
As you promised, Tiz is mine!

00:15:53.310 --> 00:15:54.010
Thor!

00:15:55.200 --> 00:15:55.980
Brat!

00:15:56.240 --> 00:15:57.390
You've got to be kidding!!!

00:15:57.460 --> 00:16:02.320
Wait! A promise is a promise.

00:16:12.610 --> 00:16:13.280
Sao!!!

00:16:14.420 --> 00:16:16.200
Don't move! It's Verasona.

00:16:16.770 --> 00:16:17.620
Verasona?

00:16:18.230 --> 00:16:20.790
One of the most dangerous plants.

00:16:21.340 --> 00:16:24.120
There could be a nest of Verasona right under us.

00:16:25.770 --> 00:16:28.210
It won't be killed if we don't kill the bulb.

00:16:28.560 --> 00:16:31.880
I'll take care of things here; no one else move!!!

00:16:32.400 --> 00:16:33.960
Nao, throw me the gun.

00:16:34.420 --> 00:16:35.120
Yes!

00:16:37.380 --> 00:16:39.680
If I'm killed, run away.

00:16:58.800 --> 00:16:59.490
It's coming!

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:08.250
There you are?

00:17:10.320 --> 00:17:11.090
Did it!

00:17:12.170 --> 00:17:13.020
Not yet!!!

00:17:16.000 --> 00:17:16.650
Damn!

00:17:27.380 --> 00:17:29.520
While it's attention's attracted to Chen...

00:17:30.990 --> 00:17:31.710
Thor!

00:17:48.230 --> 00:17:49.120
Could it be...

00:17:52.750 --> 00:17:54.300
You!!!

00:18:02.490 --> 00:18:03.530
Thor!

00:18:14.480 --> 00:18:16.650
It's finished, right?

00:18:17.850 --> 00:18:18.820
Thor!

00:18:25.810 --> 00:18:27.960
Thor! You're amazing! Amazing!

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:31.960
It's the first time I've ever seen

00:18:32.070 --> 00:18:34.590
anyone kill a Verasona on their own!

00:18:35.520 --> 00:18:36.160
Thor!

00:18:37.960 --> 00:18:39.760
We were saved by your assistance.

00:18:40.250 --> 00:18:41.050
You have our thanks.

00:18:42.450 --> 00:18:45.440
Still, you even got close to the bulb...

00:18:45.920 --> 00:18:48.490
Actually, I've done Gymnastics before

00:18:48.980 --> 00:18:50.350
- I always got A's!

00:18:53.350 --> 00:18:55.580
It looks like there's no need for meditation.

00:18:59.250 --> 00:18:59.900
Third!

00:19:00.970 --> 00:19:03.000
No, no; your safety is the most important thing.

00:19:03.920 --> 00:19:06.130
On behalf of the Ochre Ring, I've come to welcome you,

00:19:07.440 --> 00:19:08.330
Top Chen.

00:19:15.690 --> 00:19:16.840
It's great, isn't it?

00:19:17.590 --> 00:19:20.170
Tiz became your subordinate at a glance.

00:19:21.020 --> 00:19:22.760
Why aren't you telling me off?

00:19:23.560 --> 00:19:25.410
I left the Ring without permission.

00:19:26.710 --> 00:19:28.220
Do wish to leave this planet?

00:19:29.180 --> 00:19:31.430
I want to go back to Juno.

00:19:31.920 --> 00:19:35.480
And I have something I need to confirm with Odin.

00:19:36.640 --> 00:19:42.240
Zagi said, only the Jyu Oh has the right to leave the planet.

00:19:43.290 --> 00:19:45.780
If I go to Dagger Pagoda and see the Jyu Oh...

00:19:50.290 --> 00:19:51.800
What's so funny?!

00:19:52.300 --> 00:19:54.920
You really are a funny guy.

00:19:56.020 --> 00:19:59.670
The Jyu Oh's orders may have come from Hecate.

00:20:00.570 --> 00:20:02.720
It's a shame but there's no Jyu Oh in Chimera.

00:20:04.390 --> 00:20:05.630
There isn't?

00:20:06.680 --> 00:20:08.300
But we can't say there's no other method...

00:20:09.550 --> 00:20:11.170
If you become Jyu Oh, it's possible.

00:20:12.390 --> 00:20:14.520
Anyone who puts their name forward is a candidate.

00:20:15.140 --> 00:20:16.480
You also have a chance.

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:18.570
This is weird!

00:20:19.010 --> 00:20:21.440
Then why don't you become Jyu Oh?!

00:20:22.570 --> 00:20:26.530
Listen, owning reliable subordinates is a key to being a conqueror.

00:20:27.520 --> 00:20:31.010
As for me, I really hate responsibilities.

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:34.000
I can't be a Top or a King.

00:20:34.770 --> 00:20:37.280
Nor can I be a Second who bears the pressure from below.

00:20:38.440 --> 00:20:39.600
Therefore, I'm a Third.

00:20:40.370 --> 00:20:41.570
That's all I want.

00:20:42.960 --> 00:20:45.590
Third, what's your name?

00:20:48.810 --> 00:20:49.760
... it's Third.

00:20:50.270 --> 00:20:51.970
But isn't that just what people call you?

00:20:52.170 --> 00:20:53.270
It's not your name.

00:20:53.620 --> 00:20:54.640
I forget...

00:20:55.330 --> 00:20:58.700
I'm just a Third looking forward to watching all the interesting things that are going to happen next.

00:20:59.320 --> 00:21:00.250
That's all there is to it.
